  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thimphu Road Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will improve the mobility of residents in the country&amp;apos;s capital, Thimphu, by undertaking essential road improvements of urban roads, and the construction of drainage and pedestrian infrastructure. The project will further support the capacity enhancement of Thimphu Thromde officers for undertaking crucial road asset management.</narrative>
  </description>
